```

## Integration Points

### WindowCaptureEvents

Both capture methods use ImageProcessor:

```swift
// ScreenCaptureKit (macOS 14+)
SCScreenshotManager.captureImage(...) { cgImage, error in
    ImageProcessor.processImage(cgImage, windowId: id) { decoded in
        window.refreshThumbnail(.cgImage(decoded))
    }
}

// Private API (fallback)
let cgImage = oneTimeCapture(windowId)
ImageProcessor.processImage(cgImage, windowId: id) { decoded in
    window?.refreshThumbnail(.cgImage(decoded))
}
```

### CacheManager

```swift
private static func clearImageCaches() {
    ImageProcessor.clearAllCaches()
}
```

